<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warwickshire beat Somerset by 37</p>
<p>runs in an English Sunday League cricket match played under</p>
<p>floodlights at Edgbaston on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Warwickshire 224-5, 40 overs innings closed.</p>
<p>Somerset 187 in 39.2 overs.</p>
</text>
